          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:plastic#e-38cadd1d66fb3e2f",
          "text": "You’ve heard that plastic is polluting the oceans – between 4.8 and 12.7 million tonnes enter ocean ecosystems every year.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2021-national-b",
            "paperTitle": "2021年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试（全国乙卷）",
