        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:plastic#e-3a894ce9e825d339",
          "text": "For this work, titled “Truckload of Plastic,” Von Wong and a group of volunteers collected more than 10,000 pieces of plastic, which were then tied together to look like they’d been dumped（倾倒）from a truck all at once.",
